{"seq":2,"slug":"aurora-spanner-cockroach","title":"Aurora、Spanner 与 CockroachDB 架构对比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns/relational-databases/aurora-spanner-cockroach","wordCount":1414,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"aurora-spanner-与-cockroachdb-架构对比\">Aurora、Spanner 与 CockroachDB 架构对比</h1><p>三款产品代表了分布式关系型数据库的三条演化路径：Aurora DSQL 从存储-计算分离的云原生架构出发，Spanner 从 Google 内部的全球时钟同步基础设施生长而来，CockroachDB 以开源 Raft 共识为基础构建了一个可自部署的分布式 SQL 层。它们都宣称提供强一致的分布式事务，但架构取舍截然不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>三款分布式关系型数据库的核心差异归结为三个设计选择：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>时钟模型</strong>：TrueTime（物理原子钟）vs HLC（混合逻辑时钟）vs 逻辑时钟——决定了跨区域写入延迟的下界</li>\n<li><strong>共识机制</strong>：无 leader 裁决器 vs Paxos vs Raft——决定了写路径的复杂度和故障恢复行为</li>\n<li><strong>运维模型</strong>：完全 serverless vs 按节点 vs 可自部署——决定了成本结构和厂商锁定程度</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"架构总览\">架构总览</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph Aurora_DSQL[Aurora DSQL]&#10;        AD_QP[查询处理器] --&gt; AD_ADJ[裁决器 Adjudicator]&#10;        AD_ADJ --&gt; AD_JRN[事务日志 Journal]&#10;        AD_JRN --&gt; AD_XBAR[交叉开关 Crossbar]&#10;        AD_XBAR --&gt; AD_STORE[分布式存储]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Spanner&#10;        SP_FE[前端] --&gt; SP_SPLIT[Split Server]&#10;        SP_SPLIT --&gt; SP_PAXOS[Paxos Group]&#10;        SP_PAXOS --&gt; SP_CFS[Colossus 文件系统]&#10;        SP_TT[TrueTime] -.-&gt; SP_SPLIT&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph CockroachDB&#10;        CR_SQL[SQL 层] --&gt; CR_KV[事务 KV 层]&#10;        CR_KV --&gt; CR_RAFT[Raft Group]&#10;        CR_RAFT --&gt; CR_ROCK[Pebble 存储引擎]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph Aurora_DSQL[Aurora DSQL]\n        AD_QP[查询处理器] --&gt; AD_ADJ[裁决器 Adjudicator]\n        AD_ADJ --&gt; AD_JRN[事务日志 Journal]\n        AD_JRN --&gt; AD_XBAR[交叉开关 Crossbar]\n        AD_XBAR --&gt; AD_STORE[分布式存储]\n    end\n    subgraph Spanner\n        SP_FE[前端] --&gt; SP_SPLIT[Split Server]\n        SP_SPLIT --&gt; SP_PAXOS[Paxos Group]\n        SP_PAXOS --&gt; SP_CFS[Colossus 文件系统]\n        SP_TT[TrueTime] -.-&gt; SP_SPLIT\n    end\n    subgraph CockroachDB\n        CR_SQL[SQL 层] --&gt; CR_KV[事务 KV 层]\n        CR_KV --&gt; CR_RAFT[Raft Group]\n        CR_RAFT --&gt; CR_ROCK[Pebble 存储引擎]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"核心架构差异\">核心架构差异</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Aurora DSQL</th>\n<th>Spanner</th>\n<th>CockroachDB</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时钟同步</td>\n<td>逻辑时钟 + 分布式提交</td>\n<td>TrueTime（原子钟+GPS）</td>\n<td>混合逻辑时钟 HLC</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>共识协议</td>\n<td>自研裁决器（无 leader）</td>\n<td>Paxos</td>\n<td>Raft</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存储引擎</td>\n<td>云原生分布式存储</td>\n<td>Colossus（内部）</td>\n<td>Pebble（LSM-tree）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分片策略</td>\n<td>自动（对用户透明）</td>\n<td>基于主键范围的 Split</td>\n<td>基于主键范围的 Range</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多区域模式</td>\n<td>Active-Active + Witness</td>\n<td>Multi-region（leader 可指定）</td>\n<td>Survival Goals + Locality</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PostgreSQL 兼容</td>\n<td>有限 PG 子集</td>\n<td>PG 接口（有限）</td>\n<td>高兼容度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运维模型</td>\n<td>完全 serverless</td>\n<td>按节点计费</td>\n<td>Cloud 三层/自部署</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"事务提交机制对比\">事务提交机制对比</h2><p>三者实现强一致分布式事务的路径不同，直接影响写延迟：</p>\n<p><strong>Aurora DSQL</strong> 的裁决器模型：事务提交时不需要跨节点协调锁——每个写操作被序列化到 Journal，Adjudicator 在提交阶段检测冲突。如果无冲突则提交成功，有冲突则中止一方。这种乐观并发控制避免了分布式锁的延迟开销。</p>\n<p>单区域写延迟公式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{write} \\approx L_{compute} + L_{journal} + L_{adjudicate}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">na</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{journal}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">na</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是写入事务日志的同步延迟（跨 3 AZ），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{adjudicate}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是冲突检测延迟。实测 P50 约 5-8ms。</p>\n<p><strong>Spanner</strong> 的 TrueTime 模型：利用原子钟和 GPS 接收器提供全球统一的时间上界 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span>（通常 &lt; 7ms）。事务提交后必须等待 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 才能对外可见（commit-wait），确保线性化：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≥</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>ϵ</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{write} \\geq 2\\epsilon + L_{paxos}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">os</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>单区域 P50 约 6-10ms，跨区域 P50 约 50-100ms。</p>\n<p><strong>CockroachDB</strong> 的 HLC + Raft 模型：混合逻辑时钟不依赖特殊硬件，但引入了时钟不确定性窗口。当事务的时间戳落入另一个节点的不确定性区间时，必须重启事务（uncertainty restart）。Raft 共识要求 majority quorum 确认：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{write} \\approx L_{latch} + L_{raft\\_propose} + L_{raft\\_commit}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ose</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">mmi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>单区域 P50 约 4-8ms，跨区域 P50 约 70-200ms（取决于 quorum 分布）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"读取路径对比\">读取路径对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>读模式</th>\n<th>Aurora DSQL</th>\n<th>Spanner</th>\n<th>CockroachDB</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>强一致读</td>\n<td>任意节点（存储层同步）</td>\n<td>Leader（或 bounded staleness）</td>\n<td>Leaseholder</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Follower Read</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>Stale Read（可配延迟）</td>\n<td>Follower Read（4.8s 默认）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全球读延迟</td>\n<td>本地 AZ 延迟</td>\n<td>Stale: 本地；Strong: leader RTT</td>\n<td>Follower: 本地；Strong: leaseholder RTT</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"扩展性上限\">扩展性上限</h2><p>三者的水平扩展机制决定了各自的吞吐量天花板：</p>\n<p><strong>Aurora DSQL</strong>：计算、提交、存储各层独立扩展，无固定 leader 也无分片上限。AWS 宣称「virtually unlimited scale」——实测在单区域内线性扩展到数万 TPS 无明显退化。</p>\n<p><strong>Spanner</strong>：按 node-hour 计费，每个节点提供约 10000 读 QPS 或 2000 写 QPS。水平扩展通过增加节点，splits 自动重平衡。上限取决于预算而非架构。2026 年新增 Columnar Engine（GA），支持 HTAP 混合负载。</p>\n<p><strong>CockroachDB</strong>：Basic 层限制 30K RU/s（约 60 vCPU），Standard 层最高 200 vCPU，Advanced 层无上限。自部署版本可线性扩展到数百节点。关键瓶颈是 Range 的热点：单个 Range（默认 512 MB）的写入受限于其 Raft leader。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成本对比场景\">成本对比场景</h2><p>以一个典型的全球电商后端（3 区域、10000 TPS 混合读写）为例：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成本维度</th>\n<th>Aurora DSQL</th>\n<th>Spanner</th>\n<th>CockroachDB Advanced</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>计算/月</td>\n<td>~$2,500（按用量）</td>\n<td>~$3,800（6 nodes × 3 regions）</td>\n<td>~$4,200（12 vCPU × 3 regions）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存储 500GB/月</td>\n<td>~$150</td>\n<td>~$150</td>\n<td>~$250</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络（跨区域）/月</td>\n<td>~$200</td>\n<td>~$300</td>\n<td>~$350</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运维人力</td>\n<td>极低（全托管）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中（配置调优）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>月总计</strong></td>\n<td><strong>~$2,850</strong></td>\n<td><strong>~$4,250</strong></td>\n<td><strong>~$4,800</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意：Aurora DSQL 的成本优势来源于其 serverless 架构——闲时不计费。如果工作负载持续满载，三者成本趋同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"选型决策指南\">选型决策指南</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>你的场景</th>\n<th>推荐</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>AWS 重度用户 + 新项目</td>\n<td>Aurora DSQL</td>\n<td>零运维 + AWS 生态集成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Google 生态 + 极致一致性</td>\n<td>Spanner</td>\n<td>TrueTime 提供最小的时间不确定性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多云/混合部署需求</td>\n<td>CockroachDB</td>\n<td>唯一可自部署的选项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存量 PG 应用迁移</td>\n<td>CockroachDB</td>\n<td>PG 兼容度最高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全球金融交易</td>\n<td>Aurora DSQL 或 Spanner</td>\n<td>多区域 Active-Active + 强一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预算紧张 + 流量可变</td>\n<td>Aurora DSQL</td>\n<td>Serverless 按量计费</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>无论选择哪个，当数据量增长到单实例上限时，都需要面对扩展策略的选择——这正是 <a href=\"read-replica-sharding\">读副本与分片策略</a> 讨论的主题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Aurora DSQL、Spanner 和 CockroachDB 三者都提供分布式强一致事务，但架构取舍使它们适合不同的组织环境：Aurora DSQL 适合 AWS 重度用户追求零运维；Spanner 适合 Google 生态用户需要最小时间不确定性；CockroachDB 是唯一的多云/自部署选项，且 PostgreSQL 兼容度最高。选择时需要权衡的不仅是技术指标，还有厂商锁定的退出成本——Aurora DSQL 和 Spanner 一旦深度使用，迁移代价以年计。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Aurora、Spanner 与 CockroachDB 架构对比","id":"aurora-spanner-与-cockroachdb-架构对比"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"架构总览","id":"架构总览"},{"level":2,"text":"核心架构差异","id":"核心架构差异"},{"level":2,"text":"事务提交机制对比","id":"事务提交机制对比"},{"level":2,"text":"读取路径对比","id":"读取路径对比"},{"level":2,"text":"扩展性上限","id":"扩展性上限"},{"level":2,"text":"成本对比场景","id":"成本对比场景"},{"level":2,"text":"选型决策指南","id":"选型决策指南"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"托管关系型数据库服务对比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns/relational-databases/managed-rds-comparison"},"next":{"title":"读副本与分片策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns/relational-databases/read-replica-sharding"}}